        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) The Skill Classification and Recertification Reviews, Wage Treatment on Transfers between Work Locations with Different Wage Schedules, Responsibility for the Work of Others or Classroom Training Delivery, and the Special City Allowance provisions of Article 12 - Wages do not apply.",
